unty runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. January to February came in under 90% of normal in 33 of those years, and August to September did the same. In 2025, August to September on the middle of the grids hit 54% of normal. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 200% of normal, and every grid&rsquo;s driest year was 1963, with grid 27786 at 60%.</p>"}
